GAP (1/13,2/25): width = 2/25-1/13 = 1/325 = 1/(13*25) = 1/325
  Farey neighbors: |2*13 - 1*25| = 1 (=1, confirmed). The two boundary
  denominators 13 (prime, AP/pinning side) and 25=5^2 (kps mod-25 loose side) MULTIPLY to the width denom.

kps mod-25 gate: a gap member (M<2/25) must contain a MULTIPLE OF 25. Verify + explore at N=12:
  N=6 {1,5,6,11,16,17}    : 2N+1=13, mult of 13? False ; N+1=7, mult of 7? False
